# DACore email (on demand)

If this task sends mail, seeds templates, or picks an SMTP sender: **read** `AIRULES/38-DACORE-EMAIL.md` and `AIRULES/examples/EX-D06-dacore-email.md` before writing code.

Do not invent SMTP. Call `DotApp::call("DACore:Email@…!")`. Inbox bell is `AIRULES/37`.
